      "content": "that's a good start, but it's still a bit too \"politician-y\" and polished. can you make it more grounded? like, give me a version where he talks about the actual cost of these treaties—how they drain the economy and how they prioritize global stability over the everyday american worker. i want him to argue that the globalist approach isn't just misguided, but fundamentally broken and destructive to the soul of the country. make it feel like there's no other way out but this path.",
